IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `wopa-pensions`

-- Widows' and Orphans' Pension Act 1904, ss 2, 4, 5, 12-14, 22, 23, 25, 27, 29-34, 38, 39 and First Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_widows-and-orphans-pension-act-1904.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

